[h2]Build 0.9.9[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]The Bughunter power suit: built for clearing insect hives. Very hard to cut, bite or burn, hits harder up close, slower than the Bulwark.
[/list]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]The power suit is now the Bulwark, with all-new art: a bigger heavy suit with bolted chest plates, hooked shoulder plates and a tall power-cell backpack. Suits in existing saves become Bulwarks.
[*]Suits are now drawn piece by piece (body, legs, arms, helmet), ready for fitted weapon arms and pieces that break off in later builds.
[/list]
